    <abstract id="aspace_6ee0522ca291d88669f4ac0c9850789e">This collection consists of 358 color photographs taken by arts administrator, curator and artist Paul J. Smith (1931-2020). The photos document various parades and events that took place in New York City between 1996 and 2016.</abstract>
